WEBVTT

01:29.505 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:36.745 --> 01:37.745
Do you think

01:38.865 --> 01:40.745
I won't kill you?

01:43.585 --> 01:44.745
That's for Your Highness

01:46.065 --> 01:46.985
to decide.

01:52.025 --> 01:52.985
I only remember

01:55.545 --> 01:56.905
that Her Highness loved
the world beyond the palace.

01:58.545 --> 02:00.225
She wanted to leave
and see the flower fields.

02:03.265 --> 02:04.345
I didn't want her to have any regrets.

02:04.425 --> 02:05.465
Bring her back

02:07.545 --> 02:09.185
in two hours.

03:03.745 --> 03:04.865
I've returned.

03:09.265 --> 03:10.465
I've brought you to see the flower fields.

03:26.345 --> 03:28.025
QING

03:33.665 --> 03:37.785
YING

04:32.545 --> 04:33.505
Li Hongqing,

04:34.185 --> 04:37.305
I'm glad I found you.

04:41.225 --> 04:43.985
It's been seven days and
ten hours since I last saw you.

04:44.065 --> 04:45.625
I've been thinking of you constantly.

04:46.985 --> 04:49.145
Unable to eat or sleep.

04:49.225 --> 04:50.585
-Your Highness.
-I'm fond of you.

04:51.105 --> 04:53.185
Do you feel the same?

04:54.985 --> 04:56.345
Can you really take me out of the palace?

04:57.105 --> 04:59.585
Can we travel the rivers and mountains,

05:01.105 --> 05:02.225
see the fields of flowers?

05:58.265 --> 05:59.585
Look, Your Highness.

06:40.145 --> 06:42.025
Why didn't you wait for me?

06:45.545 --> 06:47.625
Why couldn't you have
waited just a bit longer…

07:17.465 --> 07:19.265
BLESSINGS AND FORTUNE

07:38.385 --> 07:39.345
Ying,

07:41.305 --> 07:43.145
when you were little,

07:43.225 --> 07:46.025
you were born round and chubby.

07:47.665 --> 07:50.545
I loved holding you close to me

07:51.505 --> 07:52.545
in my arms.

07:55.425 --> 07:57.025
Your big eyes

07:57.105 --> 08:00.425
would sparkle at me, smiling.

08:12.265 --> 08:14.785
Your Majesty,
Preceptor Du requests an audience.

08:26.745 --> 08:28.545
I've heard about Princess Ying.

08:29.385 --> 08:32.065
Please accept my condolences.

08:34.385 --> 08:36.345
I've copied scriptures for Princess Ying.

08:37.105 --> 08:39.585
I pray she ascends to bliss swiftly.

08:40.545 --> 08:41.585
I didn't expect you

08:41.664 --> 08:45.145
to come to my
Xuanguang Hall of your own accord.

08:49.265 --> 08:50.865
I'm merely grieving

08:51.785 --> 08:53.025
for Her Highness.

08:54.065 --> 08:55.265
I heard

08:56.105 --> 08:58.865
Her Highness was regaining her senses.

08:58.945 --> 09:00.105
But after Your Majesty's visit,

09:01.105 --> 09:02.465
she passed away.

09:06.785 --> 09:08.265
My Ying

09:09.425 --> 09:11.505
was always improving and relapsing.

09:12.305 --> 09:15.265
I never thought
His Majesty would cause her death.

09:15.345 --> 09:16.425
I understand.

09:17.305 --> 09:18.945
Your Majesty had no choice.

09:19.625 --> 09:21.785
You didn't want Ying to
suffer longer in this world.

09:26.945 --> 09:28.625
I don't understand

09:29.465 --> 09:30.705
what

09:31.225 --> 09:32.865
you mean.

09:36.625 --> 09:38.625
The late Emperor died suddenly,

09:38.705 --> 09:40.665
followed by the fire at Luling Palace,

09:40.745 --> 09:43.665
leaving Princess Ying deranged.

09:45.745 --> 09:46.945
Her life

09:47.705 --> 09:49.305
has been full of hardship.

09:50.145 --> 09:51.945
What exactly brings you

09:52.865 --> 09:54.225
here today?

09:56.545 --> 09:58.145
Since my youth,

09:59.105 --> 10:00.145
I've served at His Majesty's side.

10:03.105 --> 10:04.785
I wanted to serve

10:06.305 --> 10:09.425
a wise ruler who could bring hope
to Great Qi.

10:11.185 --> 10:12.145
Indeed.

10:13.225 --> 10:15.545
You've always been loyal to him.

10:16.145 --> 10:18.425
But now I no longer wish to be.

10:23.825 --> 10:25.505
I want to help you

10:26.305 --> 10:28.705
eliminate your real threat.

10:30.905 --> 10:33.945
I intend to aid the Prince of Yuzhang
in seizing the throne.

10:36.545 --> 10:37.385
Why?

10:41.865 --> 10:43.225
Why?

10:45.945 --> 10:47.265
Perhaps it's because

10:49.025 --> 10:50.385
I've been betrayed.

10:52.785 --> 10:54.945
You give everything to someone,

10:56.345 --> 10:58.665
yet he drifts further away

10:58.745 --> 11:00.585
for an unworthy cause.

11:01.665 --> 11:04.945
Disappointment turns to hatred over time.

11:06.385 --> 11:07.985
Then, hatred festers

11:08.945 --> 11:10.305
until you want him gone.

11:14.025 --> 11:15.385
Surely, you must know

11:18.585 --> 11:20.665
that feeling.

11:23.025 --> 11:26.985
I don't understand your intentions.

11:39.065 --> 11:41.225
Do you know what you're saying?

11:41.905 --> 11:43.105
Unless you do this,

11:43.665 --> 11:47.665
the Prince of Yuzhang's heart
will always be with his brother.

11:47.745 --> 11:49.545
You'll never win it back.

11:58.185 --> 12:00.065
You must fan the flames of
his resentment toward His Majesty.

12:01.105 --> 12:02.225
Turn the brothers against each other

12:02.905 --> 12:04.505
unto death.

12:04.585 --> 12:06.385
Only then will he fight for the throne.

12:10.105 --> 12:11.865
Princess Ying's death

12:12.785 --> 12:15.145
has lit the first fire.

12:17.385 --> 12:19.025
But it's not enough.

12:25.865 --> 12:27.425
What do you mean?

12:28.905 --> 12:31.025
Does Your Majesty dare to stake your life?

12:41.185 --> 12:42.585
I have a poison here.

12:42.665 --> 12:46.905
Upon taking it,
one's breath and pulse quickly cease,

12:46.985 --> 12:48.945
plunging you into a deathlike trance

12:49.025 --> 12:50.465
while you remain fully conscious.

12:50.545 --> 12:52.625
The antidote

12:52.705 --> 12:54.945
will revive you in
moments from that sham death.

13:04.585 --> 13:07.865
This slice of ginseng
has been pre-soaked in the antidote.

13:08.905 --> 13:10.345
You can have a trusted aide

13:10.425 --> 13:14.345
brew it into tea afterward,

13:15.625 --> 13:17.425
or hold it under your tongue

13:17.505 --> 13:19.505
before you take the poison.

13:20.185 --> 13:21.825
The toxin

13:22.745 --> 13:23.825
will clear

13:25.225 --> 13:26.505
after 48 hours.

13:36.305 --> 13:38.025
Do you think me

13:38.785 --> 13:41.025
so easily deceived?

13:56.505 --> 13:57.625
Please choose one, Your Majesty.

14:08.025 --> 14:09.945
Fortune favors the bold.

14:10.025 --> 14:12.745
No victory comes without risk.

14:15.025 --> 14:16.985
Coming here to pledge allegiance

14:17.985 --> 14:20.945
means I've burned my bridges.

14:28.105 --> 14:29.865
The antidote is right here.

14:31.705 --> 14:33.825
Only you and I are present.

14:34.545 --> 14:36.065
If you doubt me,

14:36.745 --> 14:37.945
don't save me.

14:58.305 --> 15:00.145
Fortune favors the bold.

15:00.225 --> 15:03.265
No victory comes without risk.

15:05.145 --> 15:06.945
It's time to take the gamble.

15:29.385 --> 15:30.265
Father!

15:30.905 --> 15:32.545
Your Majesty, what brings you here?

15:37.345 --> 15:38.545
Physician Li,

15:38.625 --> 15:40.025
didn't you send word to the palace

15:40.105 --> 15:41.905
that my father showed signs of waking?

15:42.665 --> 15:44.825
Me? I…

15:46.945 --> 15:47.785
I don't recall…

15:54.265 --> 15:55.185
Oh, no.

15:56.105 --> 15:56.945
It's Xiao Huan.

15:58.825 --> 15:59.745
Something has happened in the palace.

16:01.825 --> 16:02.945
The Imperial Father-in-law has awakened!

16:27.945 --> 16:28.865
Father.

16:31.625 --> 16:32.585
Father.

16:34.225 --> 16:35.065
You're awake.

16:37.385 --> 16:38.345
Father!

16:43.345 --> 16:45.545
-Cangcang…
-Yes? What is it?

16:47.505 --> 16:48.465
Preceptor Du…

16:52.585 --> 16:53.625
Preceptor Du?

17:17.505 --> 17:19.424
He knew Preceptor Du was the mastermind,

17:20.345 --> 17:22.145
so he arranged to draw
me away from the palace.

17:29.025 --> 17:30.185
Cangcang…

17:32.385 --> 17:34.945
Entrusting the jade seal to you

17:35.905 --> 17:37.625
was his way

17:38.425 --> 17:40.425
of ensuring your survival

17:41.945 --> 17:43.305
and leaving

17:44.225 --> 17:45.745
his last spark of hope.

17:47.465 --> 17:48.745
He won't succeed.

17:49.625 --> 17:52.585
I vowed I'd stand or fall with him.

18:04.785 --> 18:07.065
I can make it. Xiao Huan,

18:08.065 --> 18:09.345
wait for me.

18:43.065 --> 18:44.305
I'm sorry.

18:48.425 --> 18:50.305
For some reason,

18:50.385 --> 18:52.545
I felt I had to say that to you.

18:56.225 --> 18:57.225
Qianqing.

18:59.585 --> 19:00.825
Why are you here?

19:03.465 --> 19:04.705
Ying's cause of death is unclear.

19:04.785 --> 19:06.065
Regardless of what happened,

19:06.825 --> 19:09.625
I can't let her die without answers.

19:09.705 --> 19:10.545
I must investigate.

19:12.625 --> 19:14.105
Her cause of death is unclear?

19:15.465 --> 19:17.265
Weren't you the one who killed her?

19:17.985 --> 19:20.145
If she truly died because of me,

19:20.225 --> 19:22.065
I won't deny it.

19:27.905 --> 19:28.945
Don't bother.

19:33.025 --> 19:34.425
I hate myself

19:35.585 --> 19:39.505
for ever agreeing to let you
remove the poison from Ying.

19:39.585 --> 19:41.545
I should have taken her from this palace,

19:41.625 --> 19:43.585
from this wretched place.

19:44.185 --> 19:46.185
Ying's death is on our hands,

19:48.145 --> 19:49.665
you and I.

19:49.745 --> 19:50.825
Xiao Qianqing,

19:51.945 --> 19:53.345
calm yourself and think this through.

19:53.425 --> 19:55.745
Doesn't Ying's death seem suspicious?

19:57.465 --> 20:00.025
Do you want even her death exploited?

20:03.625 --> 20:04.825
Suspicious?

20:06.625 --> 20:07.505
Elaborate.

20:10.385 --> 20:12.145
She was nearly cured,

20:12.225 --> 20:13.305
then this happened out of the blue.

20:13.905 --> 20:15.505
Think harder.

20:15.585 --> 20:19.065
Maybe someone
didn't want her to regain her wits.

20:22.865 --> 20:24.065
Lies!

20:24.145 --> 20:26.185
My Ying passed without finding peace.

20:27.345 --> 20:29.945
Qianqing, look at your sister.

20:30.025 --> 20:33.025
How can you be shaken by a few words
from him?

20:34.265 --> 20:35.425
Mother,

20:35.505 --> 20:38.665
he has no reason to kill Ying at all.

20:39.345 --> 20:40.305
You forgot.

20:41.225 --> 20:42.825
Ying caused him to lose his child.

20:43.665 --> 20:44.905
The Empress's first child.

20:44.985 --> 20:46.625
Do you really believe

20:46.705 --> 20:48.705
he had no reason to harm Ying?

20:48.785 --> 20:51.345
I've said I won't pursue it.

20:52.625 --> 20:54.225
One can bide one's time for
the right opportunity to seek vengeance.

20:54.305 --> 20:57.505
Your schemes run deeper than the sea.

20:58.825 --> 21:01.585
Qianqing, will you never understand?

21:04.225 --> 21:05.225
No.

21:06.985 --> 21:08.785
We grew up together.

21:09.905 --> 21:11.065
Though he's cunning,

21:12.065 --> 21:13.425
he is not that sort of man.

21:14.905 --> 21:16.425
My foolish son.

21:17.025 --> 21:19.705
How can you be so innocent as to believe

21:19.785 --> 21:21.185
in brotherhood and sincerity

21:21.785 --> 21:23.745
within these palace walls?

21:26.985 --> 21:29.905
There's nothing to gain
from him killing Ying.

21:29.985 --> 21:31.225
Gain?

21:32.465 --> 21:35.345
Ling Xuefeng already made him wary.

21:35.945 --> 21:39.225
He fears more palace unrest,
another upheaval.

21:39.305 --> 21:41.105
He only wants to eliminate opponents.

21:41.905 --> 21:43.945
He claims Ying's death
was meant to incriminate someone.

21:44.025 --> 21:46.065
Surely it's aimed at implicating me.

21:47.985 --> 21:49.865
He already took out Ling Xuefeng.

21:49.945 --> 21:52.505
Now, it's my turn. You'll be next.

21:53.105 --> 21:56.465
We will all become sacrifices
to his consolidation of power.

22:02.265 --> 22:03.105
Empress Dowager Liu,

22:03.625 --> 22:04.985
stop weaving tales.

22:06.585 --> 22:09.265
-Trust me.
-He only wants to find the mastermind.

22:09.345 --> 22:11.785
The mastermind? Who?

22:11.865 --> 22:14.785
He is the mastermind! He killed Ying!

22:26.785 --> 22:27.745
Qianqing…

22:29.865 --> 22:30.905
Qianqing,

22:32.025 --> 22:33.385
would you rather trust him

22:34.705 --> 22:35.905
than me?

22:46.065 --> 22:47.105
Ying.

22:49.865 --> 22:50.865
Your brother

22:51.865 --> 22:53.825
distrusts and defies me

22:55.145 --> 22:56.385
utterly.

22:56.905 --> 23:00.225
I might as well
join you among the departed.

23:09.265 --> 23:10.465
Mother!

23:11.145 --> 23:13.225
Mother, what did you take?

23:14.185 --> 23:15.145
Mother!

23:21.345 --> 23:22.345
Qianqing,

23:24.705 --> 23:26.105
you've grown distant

23:27.465 --> 23:29.665
as you matured.

23:30.865 --> 23:34.145
But everything I do is for you.

23:37.585 --> 23:39.305
You may not believe me,

23:40.545 --> 23:41.865
but remember,

23:42.985 --> 23:44.505
here in this palace,

23:45.025 --> 23:46.905
all seek power and gain.

23:47.985 --> 23:49.745
Even if you refuse to contend,

23:49.825 --> 23:51.865
your foes will never spare you.

23:53.265 --> 23:54.505
Do not…

23:57.785 --> 23:58.825
Do not

24:00.065 --> 24:01.305
be deceived

24:02.425 --> 24:03.265
by him again…

24:21.865 --> 24:22.905
Mother…

24:24.345 --> 24:25.345
Mother…

24:29.265 --> 24:30.225
Mother!

24:33.545 --> 24:34.625
Mother…

24:50.265 --> 24:51.865
Are you satisfied now?

25:00.785 --> 25:01.985
Is this what you wanted?

25:06.905 --> 25:07.985
From now on,

25:09.145 --> 25:11.545
my mother will no longer vex your eyes.

25:12.745 --> 25:16.665
My sister will no longer
scheme to assassinate you.

25:17.265 --> 25:19.145
-Are you happy now?
-Qianqing.

25:21.025 --> 25:22.905
So all this,

25:23.945 --> 25:25.785
including the mastermind,

25:27.105 --> 25:29.385
was you all along! It was all you!

25:40.825 --> 25:43.065
Xiao Qianqing, have you lost your mind?

25:52.625 --> 25:55.985
HEAVEN AND EARTH

26:11.665 --> 26:13.985
YAOQING HALL

26:15.745 --> 26:16.585
Madam,

26:17.265 --> 26:18.585
the Prince of Yuzhang has
made a move against His Majesty.

26:25.105 --> 26:27.105
This day has finally come.

26:33.385 --> 26:34.225
Ms. Yan.

26:36.465 --> 26:37.625
Yes, Madam.

26:39.385 --> 26:42.185
You've always called my
mother's life fragile as paper.

26:42.265 --> 26:43.865
You're afraid love will destroy me

26:44.465 --> 26:46.145
as it did her.

26:56.865 --> 26:57.705
See here.

26:58.585 --> 27:01.345
My lifespan is long enough now, isn't it?

27:04.225 --> 27:05.065
Madam…

27:06.185 --> 27:07.185
Rest assured.

27:08.425 --> 27:10.545
I will no longer let
affections dictate my life.

27:12.185 --> 27:13.905
I will sever

27:16.145 --> 27:17.785
all these ties.

27:29.225 --> 27:31.265
My destiny rests with me, not the heavens.

27:31.865 --> 27:33.065
My only love

27:34.065 --> 27:35.345
is for myself.

27:37.105 --> 27:38.625
If heaven refuses me,

27:39.465 --> 27:41.185
I will defy it!

28:15.785 --> 28:20.745
NANRONG PALACE

28:52.825 --> 28:53.705
Is this a rebellion?

29:03.985 --> 29:05.265
Your Majesty is correct.

29:11.785 --> 29:12.625
Today,

29:13.865 --> 29:15.145
we rebel.

29:15.745 --> 29:16.945
Du Tingxin.

29:17.665 --> 29:18.865
It's you indeed.

29:19.785 --> 29:20.745
You betray me?

29:21.985 --> 29:23.185
I once served Your Majesty

29:23.705 --> 29:25.705
with loyalty.

29:26.585 --> 29:28.145
Yet,

29:28.985 --> 29:30.865
you have deeply disappointed me.

29:31.585 --> 29:34.585
You're the one behind Ling Xuefeng.

29:36.825 --> 29:38.265
What are you saying?

29:39.625 --> 29:42.385
I fail to understand.

29:47.665 --> 29:48.745
Report!

29:50.105 --> 29:52.145
Preceptor Du,
we've searched the entire palace.

29:52.225 --> 29:53.305
The Empress is not here.

29:56.985 --> 29:58.305
You let Ling Cangcang escape!

30:01.425 --> 30:02.745
Relay my orders.

30:02.825 --> 30:05.705
Should the Empress return,
kill her on sight.

30:05.785 --> 30:06.745
Understood.

30:09.025 --> 30:10.025
Du Tingxin,

30:10.705 --> 30:12.145
you dare!

30:15.105 --> 30:16.825
I have already rebelled.

30:17.425 --> 30:19.425
Why should I balk at one more death?

30:22.105 --> 30:23.425
-Kill him!
-Stop!

30:27.025 --> 30:28.305
He is the Emperor of Great Qi.

30:29.105 --> 30:30.705
You cannot kill him on a whim.

30:31.865 --> 30:32.705
Prince of Yuzhang,

30:34.065 --> 30:35.625
he has betrayed you so.

30:36.785 --> 30:38.585
Don't you want his life?

30:38.665 --> 30:39.985
My sister died.

30:41.065 --> 30:43.305
My mother died to prove her cause.

30:44.145 --> 30:47.385
Killing him outright
would be too easy on him.

31:02.025 --> 31:04.225
Take His Majesty away to rest.

31:16.785 --> 31:17.825
Prince of Yuzhang,

31:17.905 --> 31:20.465
-I'm helping you.
-Helping me?

31:21.305 --> 31:23.745
All these years,
your fealty was to Xiao Huan.

31:24.305 --> 31:26.265
Yet now you turn to aid me instead?

31:28.625 --> 31:30.185
I am the Imperial Preceptor.

31:30.825 --> 31:32.585
I serve Great Qi.

31:33.305 --> 31:34.665
My loyalty is not to one man,

31:35.305 --> 31:36.985
nor just to Xiao Huan.

31:38.025 --> 31:40.945
But to the world, to Great Qi.

31:41.905 --> 31:43.065
I choose

31:44.905 --> 31:46.945
to support Your Highness's ascension.

31:48.665 --> 31:49.985
Do you think

31:50.785 --> 31:52.425
I would trust a madwoman?

31:53.625 --> 31:56.985
I have never sought the throne.

31:57.065 --> 31:58.065
You will want it.

31:58.985 --> 32:02.185
Your brother, the current Emperor,

32:03.145 --> 32:06.025
slaughtered Princess Ying
and drove the Empress Dowager to despair,

32:07.025 --> 32:09.505
all to secure his throne.

32:09.585 --> 32:11.785
If he desires the throne so,

32:13.425 --> 32:15.505
why not take it from him?

32:17.585 --> 32:19.465
When you become Emperor,

32:21.385 --> 32:23.265
watch how remorseful

32:24.385 --> 32:27.305
your brother will be.

32:27.385 --> 32:30.105
That will be justice served.

32:35.985 --> 32:36.905
Why?

32:39.465 --> 32:40.665
Why do you revolt then?

32:51.425 --> 32:53.105
If you wish to ally with me,

32:53.665 --> 32:57.025
I must know why.

32:57.105 --> 32:59.465
Or how can I trust you?

33:00.265 --> 33:01.865
Why do I rebel?

33:02.745 --> 33:06.545
He gave Ling Cangcang
the remedy meant to save himself.

33:07.385 --> 33:08.665
His very life
I wrested from death's grasp,

33:08.745 --> 33:11.145
tending cauldrons through endless nights,

33:11.225 --> 33:13.385
testing remedies,
needling meridians without respite!

33:16.665 --> 33:18.425
If he won't cherish his life,

33:21.905 --> 33:24.425
then I must be the one to destroy it.

33:31.545 --> 33:33.945
You truly are a pitiful lunatic.

33:41.065 --> 33:41.905
Indeed.

33:43.425 --> 33:46.785
Thus, I can no longer
indulge in such affections.

33:48.705 --> 33:49.665
Either way,

33:51.705 --> 33:53.545
I no longer deserve to.

33:59.065 --> 34:01.105
On the day my mother
and Ying are laid to rest,

34:01.625 --> 34:04.105
I want Xiao Huan to die as penance.

34:05.185 --> 34:06.465
But until then,

34:09.585 --> 34:10.465
I want him alive.

34:13.225 --> 34:16.105
Very well. It shall be as you wish.

34:29.585 --> 34:35.025
LINGQUAN PALACE

35:12.385 --> 35:13.385
Leave us.

35:36.025 --> 35:38.105
Your Majesty.

35:39.865 --> 35:41.625
I know you can hear me.

35:42.905 --> 35:44.425
That's why I'm here

35:44.945 --> 35:46.305
to speak with you.

35:47.145 --> 35:49.585
You've always known who I truly am.

35:50.385 --> 35:53.505
You've never
received the late Emperor's love,

35:54.505 --> 35:58.185
so you refuse
to let any woman he favored live.

35:59.025 --> 36:01.625
My mother had to be sacrificed.

36:03.425 --> 36:04.625
Isn't that right?

36:12.185 --> 36:13.785
The truth is, the poison I gave you

36:14.825 --> 36:16.105
won't truly take effect

36:16.785 --> 36:18.345
for three days.

36:19.265 --> 36:20.545
By then,

36:22.225 --> 36:26.825
you'll already be
sealed in your lavish coffin.

36:30.345 --> 36:31.425
Mother,

36:32.145 --> 36:33.225
rest easy.

36:35.585 --> 36:38.745
I'll reclaim
everything this world owes me,

36:41.745 --> 36:43.665
piece by piece.

36:49.385 --> 36:51.185
If heaven and earth reject me,

36:55.625 --> 36:57.505
so be it.

37:17.265 --> 37:21.705
XUANGUANG HALL

37:26.745 --> 37:28.745
SPIRIT TABLET OF
EMPRESS DOWAGER LIU OF GREAT QI

37:31.945 --> 37:33.545
Kneel.

37:38.025 --> 37:40.385
Prince of Yuzhang, pardon my impertinence.

37:41.505 --> 37:44.185
But where lies Princess Ying's remains?

37:44.265 --> 37:47.265
Why is Her Highness not given a funeral
and interment in the Imperial Mausoleum?

37:47.345 --> 37:50.225
This defies all custom.

38:08.425 --> 38:12.025
I despise
your prattle of rites and tradition

38:12.105 --> 38:14.625
while meddling where you don't belong,

38:15.385 --> 38:16.905
cloaked in false virtue.

38:17.905 --> 38:20.785
Ying spent her life
confined in the cold palace.

38:21.385 --> 38:23.065
When did you ever treat her

38:23.825 --> 38:24.985
as a princess?

38:26.385 --> 38:28.545
Now that she's freed at last,

38:28.625 --> 38:31.305
you all suddenly remember her title.

38:34.545 --> 38:37.665
When she was alive,
she languished in the cold palace.

38:38.265 --> 38:39.265
In death,

38:40.505 --> 38:42.265
must she be trapped in
the Imperial Mausoleum too?

38:43.265 --> 38:47.825
His Majesty has been in indisposition.

38:47.905 --> 38:51.585
As Your Highness
handles state affairs in his stead,

38:51.665 --> 38:55.665
you should tread
carefully and uphold rites above all.

38:56.265 --> 38:57.345
Rites?

39:07.625 --> 39:09.145
What rites

39:10.825 --> 39:11.945
do you speak of?

39:12.025 --> 39:14.705
Please grant Her Highness
the proper rites befitting her title,

39:14.785 --> 39:16.065
and bury her swiftly.

39:16.145 --> 39:17.545
To heck with them!

39:19.065 --> 39:20.185
Your Highness…

39:21.425 --> 39:24.225
Minister Ding, how fortunate
you must be that your family boasts

39:24.745 --> 39:26.225
four generations under one roof.

39:27.025 --> 39:29.305
If you've never
known the grief of losing kin,

39:30.305 --> 39:32.345
I can arrange for
you to experience it now,

39:34.425 --> 39:37.385
so you shall never spout

39:37.465 --> 39:38.785
such utter nonsense again!

39:39.825 --> 39:40.825
I…

39:46.025 --> 39:47.665
You all enjoy fatherly piety,

39:48.425 --> 39:49.945
filial children,

39:50.985 --> 39:52.225
and family bliss.

39:52.745 --> 39:55.465
So why can't
you allow one departed princess

39:55.545 --> 39:56.865
her ascent to heaven?

39:59.785 --> 40:02.705
Must you deny her peace in life
and death alike?

41:23.905 --> 41:27.425
I know you're grieving too deeply
to hear anything now.

41:28.145 --> 41:29.585
So I'll say just this.

41:30.265 --> 41:32.065
I'll always be by your side.
